# Project rules

Full agent guidance lives in `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`:

| File | Scope |
|------|--------|
| `role-and-mission.mdc` | Always |
| `tech-stack.mdc` | Always |
| `architecture.mdc` | Always |
| `hackathon-directives.mdc` | Always |
| `ui-ux.mdc` | `**/*.{tsx,jsx}` |
| `coding-standards.mdc` | `**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}` |
| `api-conventions.mdc` | `api/**/*` |

Edit those files to change project rules.
